<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 595 842] /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R >> >> /Contents 17 0 R >>
endobj
17 0 obj
<< /Length 3982 >>
stream
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 790 Tm (Slide 16 - Detailed Model Results) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 767 Tm (This is important and slightly subtle:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 749 Tm (> The detailed model runs often had zero failure rate, but that did not mean) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 735 Tm (> success. The agent survived by swinging continuously.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 718 Tm (Also mention the concrete failure mode from the last week:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 700 Tm (> One agent learned a strange sideways-survival behavior: it did not really) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 686 Tm (> swing up, but it could hold or hover the pendulum around a sideways region and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 672 Tm (> jitter there. From the training reward's point of view this was better than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 658 Tm (> failing quickly, but from the control objective it was clearly wrong.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 641 Tm (Use the numbers:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 624 Tm (- `MeanFinalTheta2MAE = 1.645 rad`,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 611 Tm (- `MeanTheta2EndPeakToPeak = 6.235 rad`, almost one full revolution,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 598 Tm (- `ActionDiffRMS` low, so the action was smooth,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 585 Tm (- but smooth wrong behavior is still wrong.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 568 Tm (This is a great lesson:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 550 Tm (> Safety survival is not the same as control objective success.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 526 Tm (Slide 17 - Current Technical Bottleneck) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 503 Tm (Restate the new problem:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 485 Tm (> We are past the question of whether TD3 can move the pendulum. The question) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 471 Tm (> now is capture: how to swing up, enter the upright region, damp velocities,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 457 Tm (> and stay there without jitter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 440 Tm (Mention likely fixes:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 423 Tm (- capture reward,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 410 Tm (- state-dependent penalties,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 397 Tm (- current/action smoothing near upright,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 384 Tm (- residual/teacher-policy fine-tuning.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 360 Tm (Slide 18 - Do's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 337 Tm (This slide should feel like a postmortem, not generic advice.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 320 Tm (Start with:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 302 Tm (> These do's are not theoretical. Each one comes from something that bit us in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 288 Tm (> this project.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 271 Tm (Specific points to mention:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 254 Tm (1. Fixed evaluation was essential.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 237 Tm (   Training reward looked good multiple times while the controller was not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 224 Tm (   actually good. The narrow MathWorks-style run had no failures but poor final) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 211 Tm (   theta2 accuracy. The detailed 1c run had zero failure but was still swinging) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 198 Tm (   around instead of balancing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 181 Tm (2. Look beyond failure rate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 164 Tm (   Say:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 147 Tm (   > A controller can be safe but bad. On the detailed model the agent stayed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 134 Tm (   > inside limits, but the end-window pendulum peak-to-peak was about one full) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 121 Tm (   > revolution.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 104 Tm (   Mention metrics:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 87 Tm (- final theta2 error,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 74 Tm (- end-window theta2 oscillation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 61 Tm (- action-difference RMS,) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
