stream
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 790 Tm (- electrical energy,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 777 Tm (- current saturation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 760 Tm (3. Match the experiment configuration.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 743 Tm (   We had a real bug where parallel 500 Hz evaluation workers used a default) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 730 Tm (   200 Hz workspace config. That made old 500 Hz eval artifacts unreliable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 717 Tm (   The fix was carrying the saved run config into workers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 700 Tm (4. Change one factor at a time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 683 Tm (   The useful experiments were controlled:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 666 Tm (- small actor with same reward,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 653 Tm (- critic restored after actor/critic 1x64 failed,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 640 Tm (- arc observation tested separately,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 627 Tm (- detailed model tested before domain randomization.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 610 Tm (5. Smoke-test loaded agents.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 593 Tm (   A loaded TD3 agent can bring old exploration, warm-start, and option values.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 580 Tm (   Before fine-tuning, run a zero-exploration smoke test to check whether the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 567 Tm (   policy itself is stable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 550 Tm (6. Log hardware like data, not like a demo.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 533 Tm (   The 2026-07-07 hardware runs became useful because they were saved with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 520 Tm (   metadata, summary CSVs, quicklook plots, and aligned averages.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 496 Tm (Slide 19 - Don'ts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 473 Tm (Make this practical and project-specific:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 455 Tm (> The most dangerous mistake is to trust training reward or failure rate alone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 438 Tm (Use these examples:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 421 Tm (1. Do not present survival as balance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 404 Tm (   The detailed 1c 7000-episode run is the clean example:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 387 Tm (   FailureRate = 0) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 376 Tm (   MeanFinalTheta2MAE = 1.645 rad) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 365 Tm (   MeanTheta2EndPeakToPeak = 6.235 rad) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 350 Tm (   It learned a smooth swinging strategy, not capture.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 333 Tm (2. Do not trust old 500 Hz evaluations blindly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 316 Tm (   The parallel-worker config bug means old sample-time-sensitive 500 Hz) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 303 Tm (   comparisons must be checked. Prefer corrected `full_fixed_workspace_*`) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 290 Tm (   files.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 273 Tm (3. Do not shrink the critic too aggressively.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 256 Tm (   Actor 1x64 / critic 1x64 failed and barely acted. Actor 1x64 / critic 2x64) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 243 Tm (   learned. The critic is part of training, even if we only deploy the actor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 226 Tm (4. Do not remove direction information just to reduce observation dimension.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 209 Tm (   The unsigned arc-distance observation was elegant, but made `+angle` and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 196 Tm (   `-angle` identical. That hurt especially for theta1 arm centering.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 179 Tm (5. Do not add domain randomization too early.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 162 Tm (   We wanted to randomize after hardware mismatch, but the detailed nominal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 149 Tm (   model still did not learn capture. Randomization should make a working) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 136 Tm (   nominal controller robust; it should not hide a base-task failure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 119 Tm (6. Do not compare hardware and simulation with different action scaling.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 102 Tm (   Hardware scale `0.4` was a different effective controller from raw training) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 89 Tm (   scale `1.0`. That is fine as a safety deployment test, but it must be named) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 76 Tm (   explicitly.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
