stream
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 790 Tm (   residual policy or residual action near upright may be safer than letting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 777 Tm (   TD3 overwrite everything.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 760 Tm (3. EPOpt / robust model ensembles.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 743 Tm (   Train across a family of model variants and focus learning on difficult) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 730 Tm (   cases. This becomes relevant once the nominal detailed model can balance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 713 Tm (4. Multi-fidelity RL.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 696 Tm (   Structure the learning path from cheap/simple simulation to detailed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 683 Tm (   simulation and then hardware. This describes our practical workflow well:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 670 Tm (   simple 1b model -> detailed 1c/1d model -> hardware data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 653 Tm (5. Policy distillation / learning without forgetting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 636 Tm (   Our fine-tuning collapse suggests we need to preserve old behavior while) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 623 Tm (   adapting. A teacher-policy action-deviation penalty is the practical version) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 610 Tm (   of this idea for our MATLAB workflow.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 593 Tm (Final research takeaway:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 575 Tm (> The next step should preserve the working simple-model policy, adapt gently) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 561 Tm (> on the detailed model, and use hardware data to choose mismatch ranges. Broad) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 547 Tm (> randomization comes after nominal capture works.) Tj ET
BT /F1 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 523 Tm (Slide 23 - Final Takeaway) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 500 Tm (End with a balanced message:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 482 Tm (> The project produced a working RL training/evaluation/hardware logging) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 468 Tm (> workflow and a policy that reached hardware swing-up attempts. The remaining) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 454 Tm (> work is a well-defined sim-to-real robustness and capture problem.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 48 437 Tm (This is a good place to thank Ruprecht, Michi, and Weto for guidance.) Tj ET
endstream
